<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/20/msa@/~cl_24__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) The Board shall issue a certificate of registration to the registered Person or Engineering consultancy practice upon— (a) receipt of satisfactory evidence for his or its reinstatement; (b) satisfying such conditions as may be determined by the Board; (c) reimbursement to the Board of all expenditure incurred arising out of the proceedings leading to the cancellation of his or its registration; and (d) payment of the prescribed fee.”. Pindaan seksyen 19"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/20/msa@> .
